      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient presented with bilateral neuromas of medial dorsal nerves of the great toes. She had a 3-year history of localized tenderness and an \"electric\" type of pain. At surgery, neuromas of the dorsal medial digital nerves were identified and removed. The patient's symptoms resolved completely."},
